        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alastair Fothergill\n- People: the developer and joint producer of \"Big Cat Diary\"\n- Works: \"Big Cat Diary\", \"African Cats\", \"Aliens of the Deep\"\n- Companies: Disneynature\n- Topics: documentary filming locations\n\nFacts:\n- The developer and joint producer of \"Big Cat Diary\" co-directed \"African Cats\".\n- The developer and joint producer of \"Big Cat Diary\" also co-directed another documentary with Alastair Fothergill for Disneynature.\n- That other Disneynature documentary and \"Aliens of the Deep\" were not filmed in the same locations.",
