        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bears, Aliens of the Deep, African Cats, Big Cat Diary\n- People: Keith Scholey, Alastair Fothergill\n- Companies: Walden Media, Walt Disney Pictures, Disneynature, BBC, BBC Natural History Unit\n- Places: Alaska\n\nFacts:\n- In 1996, the first series of Big Cat Diary was broadcast on BBC One.\n- In 1996, Keith Scholey developed and jointly produced the first series of Big Cat Diary.\n- Keith Scholey later became Head of the BBC Natural History Unit.\n- Aliens of the Deep was produced by Walden Media and Walt Disney Pictures.\n- In 2014, Bears was released as a nature documentary film about a family of brown bears living in the coastal mountain ranges of Alaska.\n- Keith Scholey co-directed African Cats and Bears with Alastair Fothergill for Disneynature.",
